1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,470
Do you see that hundreds of agents raided an apartment complex in Chicago in the middle of the night taking children out naked and detaining black U.S. citizens?

2
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:14,690
This happened around 1 a.m. at a large apartment complex in the South Shore neighborhood of Chicago.

3
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:21,910
Over 300 agents from ICE, FBI, ATF, and other agents showed up to the apartment complex.

4
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,790
They came with helicopters, some people saying they saw Black Hawk helicopters, and it seems that they also came hidden in budget and U-Haul trucks.

5
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:36,830
Officials from the government said that they did this because they were looking for six high-priority targets, including suspected members of Tenderagua.

6
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:43,850
Even though they never showed a warrant while they were there, and they have not confirmed if they actually detained anyone that is a member of Tenderagua.

7
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:48,030
Agents went into nearly all of the 100 apartments that were in the complex.

8
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:51,470
They were busting down doors and dragging people out of their beds.

9
00:00:51,870 --> 00:00:56,450
There are reports of kids being zip-tied and being taken out buck naked.

10
00:00:56,450 --> 00:01:01,270
Black residents, who are U.S. citizens, also said that they were dragged out of their apartments.

11
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:07,330
They were held at gunpoint, asked to give their name, date of birth, and asked if they had any warrant.

12
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:12,350
They also separated people, Black people in one van and immigrants in the other van.

13
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:16,510
Reports say that between 30 to 40 people were disappeared that night.

14
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:22,590
Activists are trying to figure out who were the people that were disappeared since the government is not giving any information on the individuals.

15
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:26,050
This raid should be a reminder that they're coming for all of us.

16
