Look, white supremacists have done a great job of separating the Black and Latino communities, especially during the last election.

17
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:35,210
They separated us so then they can come and hunt us down.

18
00:01:35,410 --> 00:01:38,250
They don't care about any of us because of the color of our skin.

19
00:01:38,550 --> 00:01:41,370
And to any white people seeing this and say, not my problem.

20
